        "text": "The Aberrant Meatwing is a grotesque fusion of sinew and wings, gliding ominously through the air. Its body continuously emanates a tantalizing aroma of cooking meat, which is both hypnotic and revolting. While it seems to be constantly roasting itself, this creature is anything but tasty; its scent is a lure for the unwary.",
